  "notes": "Phanpy client: posts are fully rounded white cards (r 16-32px) on a pale grey #f0f2f5 page; the action bar is hidden, with only tiny corner status icons (orange heart = liked, blue bookmark = saved). Profile banner is a warm desert-mountain illustration fading into white, avatar is a large gold gradient initials circle overlapping banner. Pinned posts break out wider than the column (1055px vs 640px) with fade-out truncation and floating 'Read more ->' pill buttons. Boosted posts get a faint purple gradient tint and rocket icon header. Short posts in pinned cards scale text up. Royal blue #4169e1 used for links/hashtags with underline; FAB is a periwinkle circle with glow shadow. Capture also contains a hidden home timeline in the DOM behind the profile view."
